{"3598180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Midnight Souls", "steam_appid": 3598180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/fd1ab65842c14b477947ab48b0721e5a.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/fd1ab65842c14b477947ab48b0721e5a.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/fd1ab65842c14b477947ab48b0721e5a.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/6f0915697b78d95314db95c9d4151bce.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1156 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/6f0915697b78d95314db95c9d4151bce.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/6f0915697b78d95314db95c9d4151bce.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You venture into the sleepy hamlet of Camomile Peaks to meet your dream girl from the internet. Romance, quiet streets, and your cat Charlie in tow. Love is in the air but beneath its charm lurk chilling secrets, supernatural mysteries, and dangers that make your blood run cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover what's really happening here before it swallows you whole?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/648ced0912a93d67957bd1ba204c1904.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1156 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/648ced0912a93d67957bd1ba204c1904.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/648ced0912a93d67957bd1ba204c1904.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A gripping tale about the search for love and uncovering dark mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The snug charm of this quaint little hamlet can easily lull you into a false sense of security, and the enchanting beauty? Her smile might be a facade hiding her own dark secrets. Only a genuine hero can reveal them all, capture her heart, and survive this delightful hellhole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/ec12bb9a27fc5c7a3e88c92750291b5a.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1156 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/ec12bb9a27fc5c7a3e88c92750291b5a.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/ec12bb9a27fc5c7a3e88c92750291b5a.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles, QTEs, and a variety of mini games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mystery tests your wits and your nerves. Gather clues, make allies, take risks, and push forward until the next puzzle traps you in a dead end or reveals a new horrifying secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/7f366b5555089db8ce7a7276afa20533.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1156 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/7f366b5555089db8ce7a7276afa20533.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/7f366b5555089db8ce7a7276afa20533.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal fights and battles against <span class=\"bb_strike\">bosses and</span> your fears</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll uncover mysteries while facing enemies, physical threats, and supernatural phenomena. Dodge attacks, escape the unknown, defeat bosses, and remember: quick reflexes can save your life. Fight your own fears and inner demons: sometimes they are scarier than the real monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/57823884761cd6f246ee650197880b6e.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1156 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/57823884761cd6f246ee650197880b6e.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/57823884761cd6f246ee650197880b6e.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charlie the Cat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charlie isn't just a cat; he's your loyal sidekick and adventure partner! Keep him safe from peril, because he might save you when you least expect it!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/fd1ab65842c14b477947ab48b0721e5a.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/fd1ab65842c14b477947ab48b0721e5a.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/fd1ab65842c14b477947ab48b0721e5a.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/6f0915697b78d95314db95c9d4151bce.poster.avif?t=1787572551\" width=1156 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/6f0915697b78d95314db95c9d4151bce.webm?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598180/extras/6f0915697b78d95314db95c9d4151bce.mp4?t=1787572551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You venture into the sleepy hamlet of Camomile Peaks to meet your dream girl from the internet. Romance, quiet streets, and your cat Charlie in tow. Love is in the air but beneath its charm lurk chilling secrets, supernatural mysteries, and dangers that make your blood run cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover what's really happening here before it swallows you whole?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset